&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A master’s degree in a quantitative discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(e.g. economics, economics of competition and regulation etc.), with strong academic performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great teamwork and leadership skills.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our project work is done almost exclusively on teams, so it’s critical that our RAs work well with others.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual curiosity and creativity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for candidates who consistently want to learn more and approach problems with creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high degree of ownership and commitment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Successful RAs are committed to delivering their best work product, taking ownership of their work, and engaging in excellent client services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additionally, we look for candidates who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have data analysis experience using software such as Excel, R or Stata&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest and understanding of antitrust cases (monopolies, abuse of dominance, cartels)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for creative problem-solving; ability to communicate complex concepts effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (professional proficiency in another European language is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit the following materials through the link below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover letter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transcript(s) (unofficial copies accepted)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brattle offers a competitive benefits package, base salary, and bonus program for eligible roles based on individual and firm performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE EMPLOYER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
